7" end="4:39.814">留在这里</span> <span begin="4:40.049" end="4:40.953">还是继续</span><span begin="4:40.953" end="4:41.224">走</span> <span begin="4:41.394" end="4:42.294">我不知道</span></p><p begin="4:42.454" end="4:48.992" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:42.454" end="4:43.337">但我知道</span><span begin="4:43.337" end="4:43.990">这里一</span><span begin="4:43.990" end="4:45.074">定不是我最</span><span begin="4:45.074" end="4:45.490">终</span><span begin="4:45.870" end="4:46.817">停靠的地</span><span begin="4:46.817" end="4:47.281">方</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg"><span begin="4:42.616" end="4:43.143">(Oh,</span> <span begin="4:43.143" end="4:43.602">ba</span><span begin="4:43.602" end="4:44.392">by</span> <span begin="4:44.801" end="4:46.516">我无法入</span><span begin="4:46.516" end="4:48.992">睡)</span></span></p></div></body></tt>